@startuml sequence-password-reset
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #1E3A5F
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #8A97A8
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2E5C8A
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2FB
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #1F2937
skinparam SequenceArrowFontColor #1F2937
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F4F6F8
skinparam NoteBorderColor #8A97A8

actor "User" as U
actor "Administrator" as A
participant "Login Page" as Login
participant "Account Page" as Acct
participant "Web Dashboard" as Web
participant "NAJDA Backend" as BE
participant "Firebase Auth" as FB

== Self-service: Forgot Password (at login) ==
U -> Login : Tap "Forgot Password", enter email
Login -> FB : sendPasswordResetEmail(email)
FB --> U : Reset email delivered directly

== Self-service: Change Password (on account page) ==
U -> Acct : Enter old password + new password
Acct -> FB : reauthenticateWithCredential(oldPassword)
FB --> Acct : re-authenticated
Acct -> FB : updatePassword(newPassword)
FB --> Acct : password updated
note right
  Only available to accounts with a
  password provider -- not applicable
  to accounts that signed up with
  Google only.
end note

== Admin-generated reset link (existing account) ==
A -> Web : Request password reset\nfor a user
Web -> BE : POST /api/users/{userId}/password-reset-link
BE -> FB : getUser(uid) -- confirm a\n"password" provider exists
alt account has no password provider (e.g. Google)
  BE --> Web : 400 Bad Request\n("not applicable")
else account uses password sign-in
  BE -> FB : generatePasswordResetLink(email)
  FB --> BE : reset link
  BE --> Web : 200 OK (link returned,\nnot sent automatically)
  note right of Web
    The Admin must relay this link
    to the user themselves.
  end note
end

@enduml
